# Compiled Guile objects
*.go

# Editor backups
*~
*.swp
.#*

# Transcripts and server output live in ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_DATA}/projects/<slug>/, never
# here -- a REPL transcript contains whatever was evaluated. Belt and braces in
# case someone points --log at the working directory.
*.log
*.log.[0-9]
*.stderr
.logs/

# Core dumps
*.core
core
core.*

# Environment: .env may acquire host-local values or, by accident, a secret.
# Track the template only.
.env
.env.local
!.env.example

# The DX session's project-local Emacs profile (scripts/dx.sh). Generated, holds
# an ELPA tree and a written project.el; never the source of either.
.dx-emacs/

# Generated by assets/gen-icon.scm and assets/probe-converters.scm. Only
# assets/icon.svg is shipped -- it is byte-identical to the hypotrochoid
# candidate, so the others are regenerable noise. An untracked file here makes
# check-version-bump fail before the real suite runs, which once masked #37.
assets/icon-[0-9]*.svg
assets/icon-[0-9]*.png
